    Successfully tested with model fgas10_ramses_fork_rs, compiled with Makefile_3D_GNU_OLDMPI0_OAGERTZ_DICE_RESTARTPATCH.

    08 SEP 2025
    Reverted simulation time to t = 0, since issue with star particles persists (see Bugs below).

    29 AUG 2025
    In init_part.f90, subroutine load_ramses_dice(), set default DICE parameters IG_rho, IG_T2, IG_metal to 0 at restart to avoid adding a hot atmosphere.
    Also, now simulation time 't' is correctly set to header_amr%t rather than 0.
    Tested with model fgas10_ramses_fork_rs, compiled with Makefile_3D_GNU_OLDMPI0_OAGERTZ_DICE_RESTARTPATCH.

