    - added
        case ('ramses_dice')
           call load_ramses_dice
    - added subroutine load_ramses_dice()
    - slight modifications to subroutine load_dice()
    - replaced restart_commons by dice_restart_commons
    - replaced restart_init by dice_restart_init
    - in subroutine load_ramses_dice(), set
        IG_rho=0.0D0                 ! IGM gas density (default 1.0d-5)
        IG_T2=0.0D0                  ! IGM gas temperature (default: 1.0d7)
        IG_metal=0.0                 ! IGM metallicity (solar units)


    read_params.f90:
    Copy over the file from patch/tepper/dice_restart/ and merge with file in  oagertz/ and then with file in oagertz/dice/
